<title>NEW ZEALAND: Alliance says to meet Labour on Monday morning.</title>
<headline>Alliance says to meet Labour on Monday morning.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Labour and Alliance leaders will hold a meeting at 10.30 a.m. on Monday, a spokesman for the Alliance said.</p>
<p>Labour, which will hold a caucus on Saturday, has been briefing the Alliance on progress in its coalition negotiations with New Zealand First.</p>
<p>NZ First and National were due to meet on Friday at 2 p.m.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
